# Staff Using Random Apps for Work

Are your employees using their own accounts for company data?

When your official tools are slow or hard to use, people start using their own (like a private WhatsApp group or a personal Dropbox). This is "Shadow IT," and it's a huge security risk. Your company data is floating around in places you can't control. We solve this by building official tools that are actually faster and easier than the ones they're trying to replace.

Symptoms:
- Sensitive files being sent to personal Gmail accounts
- Unsecured file transfers you didn't approve
- Worrying about compliance rules being broken

Our solution: We look at how your team actually works and build secure, private dashboards and chat tools specifically for them. We give your staff the speed they want, while giving you the security you need.

